      "created_at": "2013-03-27T20:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They keep stacking up. However, once she is deslt damage for the first time, they ALL go away regardless of the amount of damage dealt. So even a -10 damage stack would disappear if a villains deals her 1 damage.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Have you checked out Spiff's very handy Rules and Clarifications document? It's full of helpful info:</p><p>http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf</p>",
